<main class="digital-tools-main" id="main-content">
<section class="digital-tools-hero"><div class="digital-tools-shell"><p class="eyebrow">Digital Tools</p><h1>Practical tools for learning, creating, and working smarter.</h1><p>Use free browser-based tools for learning, creating, practising, calculating, and everyday productivity.</p><div class="digital-tools-hero-actions"><a class="btn" href="#digital-tools-library">Explore Tools <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a><a class="btn secondary-btn" href="../courses.html">ICT Lessons</a></div><dl class="digital-tools-summary"><div><dt>5</dt><dd>Available now</dd></div><div><dt>6</dt><dd>Future-ready categories</dd></div><div><dt>Free</dt><dd>No account required</dd></div></dl></div></section>
<section class="digital-tools-library" id="digital-tools-library"><div class="digital-tools-shell"><header class="digital-tools-heading"><p class="eyebrow dark">Explore the Library</p><h2>Choose a category or browse everything</h2><p>Each tool has its own focused page, so it remains easy to use and easy to discover through search engines.</p></header><div aria-label="Filter digital tools by category" class="digital-tools-tabs" role="group"><button aria-pressed="true" class="is-active" data-category-filter="all" type="button">All</button><button aria-pressed="false" data-category-filter="create" type="button">Create</button><button aria-pressed="false" data-category-filter="learn-practise" type="button">Learn &amp; Practise</button><button aria-pressed="false" data-category-filter="calculate" type="button">Calculate</button><button aria-pressed="false" data-category-filter="productivity" type="button">Productivity</button><button aria-pressed="false" data-category-filter="ai-tools" type="button">AI Tools</button></div><p aria-live="polite" class="digital-tools-result" id="digitalToolsResult">Showing all tools</p><div class="digital-tools-list" id="digitalToolsList">
<article class="digital-tool-row" data-tool-category="create" data-tool-status="available"><span aria-hidden="true" class="digital-tool-icon">▦</span><div class="digital-tool-copy"><div class="digital-tool-meta"><span>Create</span><small>Available now</small></div><h3>QR Code Generator</h3><p>Create customised QR codes with a searchable selector, optional poster text, premium A4 downloads, and a clean QR-only option.</p></div><a class="digital-tool-open" href="qr-code-generator.html">Open Tool <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></article>
<article class="digital-tool-row" data-tool-category="learn-practise" data-tool-status="available"><span aria-hidden="true" class="digital-tool-icon">⌨</span><div class="digital-tool-copy"><div class="digital-tool-meta"><span>Learn &amp; Practise</span><small>Available now</small></div><h3>Typing Speed Trainer</h3><p>Improve typing speed, accuracy, focus, and digital confidence through timed beginner-friendly practice.</p></div><a class="digital-tool-open" href="typing-trainer.html">Open Tool <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></article>
<article class="digital-tool-row" data-tool-category="learn-practise" data-tool-status="available"><span aria-hidden="true" class="digital-tool-icon">⚡</span><div class="digital-tool-copy"><div class="digital-tool-meta"><span>Learn &amp; Practise</span><small>Available now</small></div><h3>Computer Shortcut Keys Trainer</h3><p>Practise useful Windows, Word, Excel, browser, and everyday keyboard shortcuts with instant correction.</p></div><a class="digital-tool-open" href="shortcut-keys-trainer.html">Open Tool <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></article>
<article class="digital-tool-row" data-tool-category="learn-practise" data-tool-status="available"><span aria-hidden="true" class="digital-tool-icon">🎮</span><div class="digital-tool-copy"><div class="digital-tool-meta"><span>Learn &amp; Practise</span><small>Available now</small></div><h3>General ICT Quiz Game</h3><p>Test computer basics, Microsoft Word, Excel, internet safety, and general ICT knowledge.</p></div><a class="digital-tool-open" href="ict-quiz.html">Open Tool <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></article>
<article class="digital-tool-row" data-tool-category="calculate" data-tool-status="available"><span aria-hidden="true" class="digital-tool-icon">🧮</span><div class="digital-tool-copy"><div class="digital-tool-meta"><span>Calculate</span><small>Available now</small></div><h3>Scientific Calculator</h3><p>Solve everyday and scientific calculations, including percentages, powers, roots, and trigonometry.</p></div><a class="digital-tool-open" href="scientific-calculator.html">Open Tool <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></article>
<article class="digital-tool-row" data-tool-category="productivity" data-tool-status="coming-soon"><span aria-hidden="true" class="digital-tool-icon">📊</span><div class="digital-tool-copy"><div class="digital-tool-meta"><span>Productivity</span><small>In development</small></div><h3>Results Analysis Templates</h3><p>Prepare marks, averages, rankings, grades, and performance summaries with future smart templates.</p></div><span class="digital-tool-coming">Coming soon</span></article>
